  "description": "Compile-time object mapping for .NET using Roslyn source generators. Add [Map(typeof(Dto))] to your domain class — AutoMap generates strongly-typed ToDto() extension methods at build time. Zero runtime overhead, no reflection, no AutoMapper dependency. Supports [MapFrom], [MapIgnore], [MapProperty], records, and structs.",
